### ----------------------------------------------------
### 🔧 get_channel_details — check `is_member` here BEFORE subscribing a trigger scoped to (or reading
### from) a channel — false means the bot can post there (chat:write.public) but Slack won't deliver ANY
### events from it, with no error anywhere. Fix with join_channel right below if false.
### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/actions/execute/SLACK_GET_CHANNEL_DETAILS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection_id": "{{slack_connection_id}}",
  "input": { "channel_id": "C0772SYKNN4" }
}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### 🔧 join_channel — join a PUBLIC channel. Needed for the bot to actually RECEIVE events (new_message,
