### a separate permission from receiving events. Needs channels:join bot scope (see .env.example). Check
### GET_CHANNEL_DETAILS' `is_member` first if a subscribed trigger never fires with no error anywhere.
### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/actions/execute/SLACK_JOIN_CHANNEL
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection_id": "{{slack_connection_id}}",
  "input": { "channel_id": "C0772SYKNN4" }
}

