### is_admin/is_owner/is_restricted/is_ultra_restricted (guest), email, tz, avatar_url.
### ----------------------------------------------------
POST {{base_url}}/actions/execute/SLACK_LIST_USERS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection_id": "{{slack_connection_id}}",
  "input": { "limit": 20 }
}

